{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":28}},"catalogue_title_with_richtext_mJBbtw":{"type":"catalogue-title-with-richtext","settings":{"show_title":true,"show_description":false,"show_main_description":true,"show_guide_price":false,"border_title":true,"heading_size":"h1","desktop_content_position":"left","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"scheme-2","custom_class":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"padding_left":0,"padding_right":0}},"catalogue_multicolumn_DFafir":{"type":"catalogue-multicolumn","blocks":{"column_CCwTha":{"type":"column","settings":{"custom_text_hover":"","title":"","subtext":"","text":"<p>It's taken us 30 years to develop the perfect furniture paint to apply by hand. It's hard enough to withstand a knock but flexible enough to allow for movement of timber, it can be wiped down and is easy to touch up after any damage. Our Shaker colours have been developed over many years and now they're finally available to buy in tins. Trinity Blue, Clerkenwell Blue, Bond Street Blue, Refectory Red, Scullery Yellow and Bakehouse Green have all been specially reformulated for this new range, we decided it was the perfect opportunity to make slight adjustments to some colours to really bring out the best in them.<\/p>","show_above_image":true,"link_label":"","link":""}},"column_dUhzaT":{"type":"column","disabled":true,"settings":{"custom_text_hover":"","title":"","subtext":"","text":"<p>Trinity Blue, Clerkenwell Blue, Bond Street Blue, Refectory Red, Scullery Yellow and Bakehouse Green have all been specially reformulated for this new range, we decided it was the perfect opportunity to make slight adjustments to some colours to really bring out the best in them.<\/p>","show_above_image":true,"link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["column_CCwTha","column_dUhzaT"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":["@media (max-width: 590px) {.description_above--image {margin-bottom: -15px; }}",".multicolumn-li